<BaseLayout
  title="Amir Baruch — Product Leadership | Employable PM"
  description="Amir Baruch: Director of Product Management (Geo, Maps & Agentic AI) at Stellantis. VP Product / Head of Product / CPO roles — mobility, automotive, maps/navigation/location, remote EU."
  noindex
>
  <p class="kicker"><span class="accent">~/profile</span></p>
  <div class="about-head">
    <img class="about-avatar" src="/images/amir-comic-logo.webp" alt="Amir Baruch, comic portrait" />
    <div>
      <h1>Amir Baruch</h1>
      <p class="profile-target">VP Product / Head of Product / CPO — mobility, automotive, maps/navigation/location — remote EU (based in Spain)</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      <strong>I bring the consumer playbook to automotive.</strong> Modern,
      impact-based product practices that turn traditional teams into
      AI-powered builders.
    </p>
    <h2>Track record</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Stellantis (2023–):</strong> Director of PM, Geo/Maps &amp;
        Agentic AI. Mapping platform across 12 automotive brands; AI-powered
        voice-first navigation. High tens of millions € annual impact from
        year one. Lead and mentor 5 PMs; moved the org from siloed operations
        to collaborative product development.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Bolt (2021–2023):</strong> Led Geo group domains (Routing
        &amp; ETA, Tracking, Mobile, Maps), ~25 people across data science,
        analytics, backend, mobile. ~€60M impact; location services beating
        external benchmarks.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Earlier:</strong> Product leadership at Telenav (Senior PM,
        Automotive EU), TomTom (Senior Product Owner, Navigation), SAP
        (Senior PM Connected Car; Product Owner planning tools), Kodak
        (Product Owner). Started as a backend engineer at SAP — technical
        enough to lead devs.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Speaking</h2>
    <ul class="speaking-list">
      <li>
        <span class="speak-kind">Keynote</span>
        <span class="speak-title">From Automotive Software to Consumer-Grade Experiences with In-Cabin Agentic AI</span>
        <span class="speak-meta">InCabin Europe, Sep 2026 <a href="https://incabin.com/session/iceur26/from-automotive-software-to-consumer-grade-experiences-with-in-cabin-agentic-ai/" aria-label="Session page"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"/><line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"/></svg></a></span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="speak-kind">Panelist</span>
        <span class="speak-title">Smart Navigation in Vehicles: Reinventing Routing and Mobility Experiences</span>
        <span class="speak-meta">Dataxis, Oct 2026</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="speak-kind">Talk</span>
        <span class="speak-title">Navigating Change: How Stellantis' Geo Group is Revolutionizing Automotive Software Development</span>
        <span class="speak-meta">PROW 2024 <a href="https://youtu.be/_c-7rhFw2Sc" aria-label="Watch on YouTube"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18"><path fill="#FF0000" d="M23.5 6.2a3 3 0 0 0-2.1-2.1C19.5 3.5 12 3.5 12 3.5s-7.5 0-9.4.6A3 3 0 0 0 .5 6.2 31.3 31.3 0 0 0 0 12a31.3 31.3 0 0 0 .5 5.8 3 3 0 0 0 2.1 2.1c1.9.6 9.4.6 9.4.6s7.5 0 9.4-.6a3 3 0 0 0 2.1-2.1A31.3 31.3 0 0 0 24 12a31.3 31.3 0 0 0-.5-5.8zM9.6 15.6V8.4L15.8 12l-6.2 3.6z"/></svg></a> <a href="https://prow.ro/speakers/amir-baruch" aria-label="Speaker profile"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"/><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"/><line x1="10" y1="14" x2="21" y2="3"/></svg></a></span>
