    <h2>How I work</h2>
    <p>
      Problem first, experiment in loops, hands-on with prototypes and code.
      Empowered teams, outcomes over output. The contrarian bit: PMs should
      be technical enough to lead devs, not stay out of the code.
    </p>
    <h2>Looking for</h2>
    <p>
      VP Product / Head of Product / CPO. Mobility, automotive,
      maps/navigation/location. Remote EU.
    </p>
